notes.content:
Sorry for not updating more levels due to personal reasons, but we finally have a selection map!

Update content:
1. Remake the selection interface and add map design;
2. Coordinate the original UI logic and optimize the code;
3. Add loading animations;
4. Delete some redundant and repetitive levels (originally 80 levels, now 60 levels) to make the puzzle solving pace more compact;
5. Reorder the levels to make the overall difficulty curve reasonable and smooth;
6. Adjust some level content to cater to level adjustments;
7. Fix logical bugs in level 60 (formerly level 80).

Forward looking:
1. Add more levels and large maps;
2.Currently, there is no correlation between the big map scene and the level scene, and adjustments will be made in the next step;
3. Add more sound effects to enhance the gaming experience;
4.The achievement system is already planned and will be launched in subsequent updates.

Wishing everyone a smooth urination! Wish me luck!
